invalid type: string "Acme Technologies - Employee Leave Policy\n\n1. Casual Leave\n\nEmployees are entitled to 12 casual leave days per calendar year.\n\nCasual leave is intended for personal or urgent requirements.\n\nEmployees should normally apply for casual leave at least 2 working days before the leave start date.\n\nUnused casual leave cannot be carried forward to the next calendar year.\n4